'''PIKOTARO''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]] and he can be unlocked by beating the [[PPAP|Pikotaro collaboration stage]] during the collaboration period.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 315
|rarity = RR
|name1 = PIKOTARO
|name2 = NEKOTARO
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''NEKOTARO''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Due to horrid stats, very long recharge time, long attack rate and especially animation and low freeze chance and uptime it is not recommended to use this cat and better use much more reliable and spammable cats with same ability like [[Evil Cat (Rare Cat)|Evil Cat]] and [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]].

However, if you are generally willing to use this, then it's best you attempt to get a stack of him going due to him having Area Attack, which therefore increases his chance of freezing and makes PIKOTARO somewhat useful, despite being replacable.

